                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Statsbyggs "Byggnummer" : A building represents a structure that provides shelter for its occupants or contents and stands in one place. The building is also used to provide a basic element within the spatial structure hierarchy for the components of a building project (together with site, storey, and space).]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
