            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004558730" name="3b0b6780d20811e1800000215ad4efdf LoadBearing : f089eb00d20711e1800000215ad4efdf Pset_SlabCommon : 200 760 771 Slab : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="0x2sU0qWWHuO00025QrE$V">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Indicates whether the object is intended to carry loads (TRUE) or not (FALSE). : Properties common to the definition of all occurrences of IfcSlab. Note: Properties for PitchAngle added in IFC 2x3 : A slab is a component of the construction that normally encloses a space vertically. The slab may provide the lower support (floor) or upper construction (roof slab) in any space in a building.]]></Body>
