            </Concept>
            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004568328" name="NONS10102 RefString : NONS10101 NONS_Reference : 200 Covering : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Sammensatt TFM-ID (kodestreng) i byggeierens foretrukne format. Det skal avtales om denne kreves, og hvilket format den skal ha. I IFC bør dette ligge i IfcXxxxxx.Tag eller i egenskapen «Reference» i Pset  IfcXxxxxxCommon. : Egenskapssett for alle TFM-relaterte egenskaper : A covering is an element which covers some part of another element and is fully dependent on that other element. The IfcCovering defines the occurrence of a covering type, that (if given) is expressed by the IfcCoveringType.
NOT to used for Ceiling, Insulation, Flooring or Membrane. Only for completing element.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
              <Template ref="00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001"/>
              <Requirements>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4366-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4367-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
