            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004573651" name="NOSSB10002 HasAcousticReq : NOSSB10001 NOSSB_ReqTriggers : 200 Covering Ceiling : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Communicates the object has acoustical requirements. Activates checking of object according to NOSSB_Acoustic : Communicates that the object must be co-designed by another discipline that adds some performance properties (e.g. acoustical or fire safety related) to the object : The covering is used to represent a ceiling.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
