            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004573861" name="NOSSB10003 HasFireSafetyReq : NOSSB10001 NOSSB_ReqTriggers : 200 Covering Ceiling : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
