                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Communicates the object has fire safety requirements. Activates checking of object according to NOSSB_Fire. Applies to elements. : Communicates that the object must be co-designed by another discipline that adds some performance properties (e.g. acoustical or fire safety related) to the object : The covering is used to represent a ceiling.]]></Body>
