                    </TemplateRules>
                  </TemplateRules>
                </TemplateRules>
              </TemplateRules>
            </Concept>
            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004564767" name="4b9feb80d1d011e1800000215ad4efdf IsExternal : 11364e80d1d011e1800000215ad4efdf Pset_CoveringCommon : 200 Covering Flooring : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="1Bd_k0qT0HuO00025QrE$V">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Indication whether the element is designed for use in the exterior (TRUE) or not (FALSE). If (TRUE) it is an external element and faces the outside of the building. : Properties common to the definition of all occurrence and type objects of covering : The covering is used to represent a flooring.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
