              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Thermal transmittance coefficient (U-Value) of an element. 
Here the total thermal transmittance coefficient through the covering (including all materials). : Properties common to the definition of all occurrence and type objects of covering : The covering is used to insulate an element for thermal or acoustic purposes.]]></Body>
