            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004558711" name="558d1300d1ff11e1800000215ad4efdf FireRating : 2d051900d1ff11e1800000215ad4efdf Pset_RampCommon : 200 Ramp : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="1LZHC0qVyHuO00025QrE$V">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Fire rating for this object.
