              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Communicates the object has fire safety requirements. Activates checking of object according to NOSSB_Fire. Applies to elements. : Communicates that the object must be co-designed by another discipline that adds some performance properties (e.g. acoustical or fire safety related) to the object : A ramp is a vertical passageway which provides a human circulation link between one floor level and another floor level at a different elevation. It may include a landing as an intermediate floor slab. A ramp normally does not include steps.]]></Body>
