            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004568316" name="NONS10102 RefString : NONS10101 NONS_Reference : 200 Wall : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Sammensatt TFM-ID (kodestreng) i byggeierens foretrukne format. Det skal avtales om denne kreves, og hvilket format den skal ha. I IFC bør dette ligge i IfcXxxxxx.Tag eller i egenskapen «Reference» i Pset  IfcXxxxxxCommon. : Egenskapssett for alle TFM-relaterte egenskaper : The wall represents a vertical construction that bounds or subdivides spaces. Wall are usually vertical, or nearly vertical, planar elements, often designed to bear structural loads. A wall is however not required to be load bearing.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
              <Template ref="00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001"/>
              <Requirements>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4366-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4367-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
              </Requirements>
