                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Varmekonduktivitet (U-verdi), oppgis i W/(m²K). : Kommuniserer krav til egenskaper for varmekonduktivitet og/eller lysfaktor. : The wall represents a vertical construction that bounds or subdivides spaces. Wall are usually vertical, or nearly vertical, planar elements, often designed to bear structural loads. A wall is however not required to be load bearing.]]></Body>
