              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Communicates the object has fire safety requirements. Activates checking of object according to NOSSB_Fire. Applies to elements. : Communicates that the object must be co-designed by another discipline that adds some performance properties (e.g. acoustical or fire safety related) to the object : The wall represents a vertical construction that bounds or subdivides spaces. Wall are usually vertical, or nearly vertical, planar elements, often designed to bear structural loads. A wall is however not required to be load bearing.]]></Body>
