            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004568317" name="NONS10102 RefString : NONS10101 NONS_Reference : 222 Column : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Sammensatt TFM-ID (kodestreng) i byggeierens foretrukne format. Det skal avtales om denne kreves, og hvilket format den skal ha. I IFC bør dette ligge i IfcXxxxxx.Tag eller i egenskapen «Reference» i Pset  IfcXxxxxxCommon. : Egenskapssett for alle TFM-relaterte egenskaper : IfcColumn is a vertical structural member which often is aligned with a structural grid intersection. It represents a vertical, or nearly vertical, structural member that transmits, through compression, the weight of the structure above to other structural elements below. It represents such a member from an architectural point of view. It is not required to be load bearing.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
              <Template ref="00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001"/>
              <Requirements>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4366-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
