            </Concept>
            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004568321" name="NONS10102 RefString : NONS10101 NONS_Reference : 234 Window : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Sammensatt TFM-ID (kodestreng) i byggeierens foretrukne format. Det skal avtales om denne kreves, og hvilket format den skal ha. I IFC bør dette ligge i IfcXxxxxx.Tag eller i egenskapen «Reference» i Pset  IfcXxxxxxCommon. : Egenskapssett for alle TFM-relaterte egenskaper : The window is a building element that is predominately used to provide natural light and fresh air. It includes vertical opening but also horizontal opening such as skylights or light domes. It includes constructions with swinging, pivoting, sliding, or revolving panels and fixed panels. A window consists of a lining and one or several panels.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
