            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004568323" name="NONS10102 RefString : NONS10101 NONS_Reference : 270 Chimney : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Sammensatt TFM-ID (kodestreng) i byggeierens foretrukne format. Det skal avtales om denne kreves, og hvilket format den skal ha. I IFC bør dette ligge i IfcXxxxxx.Tag eller i egenskapen «Reference» i Pset  IfcXxxxxxCommon. : Egenskapssett for alle TFM-relaterte egenskaper : Chimneys are typically vertical, or as near as vertical, parts of the construction of a building and part of the building fabric. Often constructed by pre-cast or insitu concrete, today seldom by bricks.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
