            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004793503" name="NONS10102 RefString : NONS10101 NONS_Reference : 290 Opening Element : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Sammensatt TFM-ID (kodestreng) i byggeierens foretrukne format. Det skal avtales om denne kreves, og hvilket format den skal ha. I IFC bør dette ligge i IfcXxxxxx.Tag eller i egenskapen «Reference» i Pset  IfcXxxxxxCommon. : Egenskapssett for alle TFM-relaterte egenskaper : The opening element stands for opening, recess or chase, all reflecting voids. It represents a void within any element that has physical manifestation. Openings can be inserted into walls, slabs, beams, columns, or other elements.]]></Body>
