            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004793572" name="0004 Predefined type : 500 Shading Device : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[[Definition from IFC]: This enumeration defines the valid types of IfcShadingDevice or IfcShadingDeviceType that can be predefined using the enumeration values.

JALOUSIE: A blind with adjustable horizontal slats for admitting light and air while excluding direct sun and rain.
SHUTTER: A mechanical devices that limits the passage of light. Often used as a a solid or louvered movable cover for a window.
AWNING: A rooflike shelter of canvas or other material extending over a doorway, from the top of a window, over a deck, or similar, in order to provide protection, as from the sun.
USERDEFINED	
NOTDEFINED : Shading devices are purpose built devices to protect from the sunlight, from natural light, or screening them from view. Shading devices can form part of the facade or can be mounted inside the building, they can be fixed or operable.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
              <Template ref="00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001"/>
              <Requirements>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4365-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4366-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4367-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
              </Requirements>
              <TemplateRules operator="or">
<TemplateRule Parameters="PredefinedType[Exists]=TRUE OR T_PredefinedType[Exists]=TRUE "/><TemplateRule Parameters=" T_TypeObject[Exists]=TRUE "/>
</TemplateRules>
            </Concept>
            <Concept uuid="00000489-4365-0000-0000-000004793613" name="NONS10008 DuplicateOwnedBy : NONS10001 NONS_Process : 500 Shading Device : 01 Architectural (ARK)" code="">
              <Definitions>
                <Definition>
                  <Body lang="en"><![CDATA[Kommuniserer at et annet fag er ansvarlig for objektet. Objektet er tatt med i modellen for å vise utseende, plassering eller lignende, men teknisk informasjon om objektet er beskrevet i modellen til faget som er ansvarlig. Dette kan for eksempel være søyler, toaletter eller lamper som er tatt med som dupliserte objekter i arkitektmodellen for å vise plasseringen, mens objektene med teknisk informasjon ligger i modellene til RIB, RIV og RIE. Verdien for egenskapen fylles ut med fagforkortelsen til faget som har ansvaret for objektet, for eksempel ARK, RIB, RIV, RIE, LARK osv. : Egenskaper for prosessinformasjon. Egenskapene legges på objektforekomster i elementer.  : Shading devices are purpose built devices to protect from the sunlight, from natural light, or screening them from view. Shading devices can form part of the facade or can be mounted inside the building, they can be fixed or operable.]]></Body>
                </Definition>
              </Definitions>
              <Template ref="00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001"/>
              <Requirements>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4365-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4366-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
                <Requirement applicability="export" exchangeRequirement="00000489-4365-4367-0000-000000000000" requirement="mandatory"/>
              </Requirements>
              <TemplateRules operator="and">
                <TemplateRules operator="or">
                  <TemplateRule Parameters="Set[Value]='NONS_Process' AND PropertyName[Value]='DuplicateOwnedBy' AND Value[Exists]=TRUE AND Value[Type]='IFCLABEL'"/>
                  <TemplateRules operator="and">
                    <TemplateRules operator="nor">
                      <TemplateRule Parameters="Set[Value]='NONS_Process' AND PropertyName[Value]='DuplicateOwnedBy'"/>
                    </TemplateRules>
                    <TemplateRules operator="or">
                      <TemplateRule Parameters="T_Set[Value]='NONS_Process' AND T_PropertyName[Value]='DuplicateOwnedBy' AND T_Value[Exists]=TRUE AND T_Value[Type]='IFCLABEL'"/>
                    </TemplateRules>
                  </TemplateRules>
                </TemplateRules>
              </TemplateRules>
            </Concept>
